findings.suggestion:
在业务层强制归属校验，并让 requester 成为必填：
def delete_post(post_id, requester):
    post = store.get_post(post_id)
    if post is None:
        return False
    if requester is None or (post.author != requester.name and requester.role != "admin"):
        raise PermissionError("无权删除该帖子")
    return store.delete_post(post_id)

存储侧改用 bcrypt/argon2/scrypt 等带盐慢哈希（如 passlib 的 CryptContext），比对侧用 hmac.compare_digest 或哈希库自带的 verify：
if user is None:
    hmac.compare_digest(password, "x")  # 保持耗时一致，避免用户名枚举
    return False
return bcrypt.checkpw(password.encode(), user.password_hash)

